[en.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_AGRICULTURE]
Magic Agriculture

[en.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_AGRICULTURE_desc]
“Your Grace, we liked the concept of general magic education. But Ponyville is an agricultural duchy, we don’t need that many unicorns or magic users. We need farmers, not magicians. What good is it in a practical world?”\n§g“What good is a new born baby?”§!

[zh.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_AGRICULTURE]
魔法农业

[zh.FOCUS_C02_MAGIC_AGRICULTURE_desc]
“公爵殿下，我们很喜欢通用魔法教育的概念。但是小马谷是一个农业领，我们不需要那么多的独角兽或者魔法使用者。我们需要的是农民，而不是魔法师。在实际应用中，这些魔法教育有什么用呢？”\n§g“新生婴儿有什么用呢？”§!

